  speakerName: Harsh
  lines:
  - Karvy seems to think that open source is a liability.
  - I disagree.
  - The community driven nature of open source software....
  - ....allows everyone to contribute to projects.
  - And open source software has better security since it allows vulnerabilities
    to be found fast.
